WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.435
-Over the weekend, the crowd

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.138
at a Trump rally
booed COVID vaccines

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:07.273
and then, this morning,
the FDA finally granted

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.141
full approval
to the Pfizer vaccine,

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.810
which is huge news
in the campaign

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.111
to get more people vaccinated.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.514
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:18.417
♪♪

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.153
Polls have shown that a sizable
portion of Americans

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:24.057
who remain unvaccinated might be
persuaded to get the shot

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.092
if the FDA granted it
full approval.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:28.627
So far, the vaccines have been
distributed under what's known

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:31.297
as an emergency use
authorization

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.533
and a poll earlier this month
found that...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.419
And, look, I'll admit,
it can be confusing to follow.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:57.424
We all wish the FDA and the CDC
could be more like the SFC,

00:00:57.424 --> 00:01:00.193 line:0%
which is an organization
where people...

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:01.427 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Trying to make sense

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:03.296
of all the announcements
and updates and guidelines

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.331
from the FDA and the CDC
can make you feel like

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.166
an out-of-towner reading one
of those signs

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.302
about service changes
on the subway...

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.679
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:22.682
Personally, I did not care
what kind of authorization

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.350
the vaccine had.
The second they said

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.253
I was eligible,
I lined up outside Javits

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:30.155
like I was trying to get tickets
to "SNL" the week BTS was on.

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:32.158
Or the week I hosted.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.093
Should've seen the sidewalk
outside 30 Rock.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:36.963
[ Laughter ]
[ Wind blowing ]

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.164
-Seth Meyers?

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.000
I thought that guy was too good
for an audience.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.603
[ Laughter ]
[ Wind blowing ]

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.973
And that's our entire
annual animation budget.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.841
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:50.576
[ Snaps fingers ]
The point is experts

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.212
have predicted that full
FDA approval of the vaccines

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:55.815
could help persuade some of the
unvaccinated to get their shots.

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.150 line:0%
Well, this morning,
the FDA finally granted

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.152 line:0%
that full approval
to Pfizer's jab,

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.188 line:0%
which is huge news
and a big boost

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.556 line:0%
to the vaccination campaign.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.126 line:0%
And not only does it
now have full approval,

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.427 line:0%
it could even be marketed
under a new name.

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:10.863 line:0%
-Breaking news. The FDA
has granted full approval

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:13.933 line:0%
to the Pfizer COVID-19 vaccine.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:17.737 line:0%
This is a key step in getting
more Americans vaccinated.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:19.439 line:0%
It comes more than nine months

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.774 line:0%
after the first dose
of the Pfizer vaccine

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.676 line:0%
was administered
in this country.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.312 line:0%
The decision could motivate
millions of Americans

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.281 line:0%
who still have not
received a vaccine

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:31.116 line:0%
to finally get the shot.

00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:32.384 line:0%
The data is behind it.

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:33.453 line:0%
It saves lives.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.287 line:0%
It keeps people
out of the hospital.

00:02:35.287 --> 00:02:39.559 line:0%
-We are now learning that
that Pfizer vaccine for COVID

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:42.161 line:0%
will be marketed
under a new name.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.830 line:0%
It will be called Comirnaty.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.501 line:0%
Comirnaty is the new name
that will be marketed

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:51.471 line:0%
for the Pfizer COVID vaccine.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.439
-This is amazing news
that will hopefully

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.307
convince more people
to get vaccinated

00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:57.877
and we should all be thrilled,
but also huge news --

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:02.014
that I guess we finally ran
out of pharmaceutical names.

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:04.083
What's up with Comirnaty?

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.551
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.551 --> 00:03:07.953
Did the approval
catch Pfizer so off-guard

00:03:07.953 --> 00:03:09.955
that they yelled out a name
before they were ready?

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:11.424
"I vote Comirnaty!"

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.592
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:14.560
Also, it had already had
a great name --

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.529
Pfizer vaccine.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.631
I mean, I understand
using a complicated name,

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:21.935
like Viberzi or Xifaxan,
for IBS drugs,

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:23.736
so you don't have
to ask your doctor about,

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.104
I don't know,
Diarrhea-Be-Gone,

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.573
[ Laughter ]
although it all goes
out the window

00:03:27.573 --> 00:03:30.776
when they have to have mascots
that are literally intestines.

00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:33.912
You know what would be a good
mascot for a vaccine drug?

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:36.449
A wallet with a vaccine card
sticking out of it

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.250
because they don't fit.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.652
[ Laughter ]
The FDA better never approve

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:41.320
this dump [bleep] shape.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.056
[ Laughter ]
Now, you might be wondering

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.391
how they came up with this name.
Apparently...

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.537
[ Inhaling ]

00:03:57.537 --> 00:04:01.407
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.743
So it actually like
makes sense, dude.

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:04.977
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:06.145
God, it's like a riddle

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:07.746
Tom Hanks would have to solve

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:08.848
in "The Da Vinci Code"

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:11.250
to find out the location
of the Holy Grail.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.484
"It's in Toledo!

00:04:12.484 --> 00:04:14.553
Wait. I don't think we
did this right."

00:04:14.553 --> 00:04:18.157
[ Laughter ]
There are so many different
words embedded in this name,

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:19.926
it's giving me flashbacks
to yesterday's

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.093
New York Times Spelling Bee.

00:04:21.093 --> 00:04:22.628
"I was one word
away from genius.

00:04:22.628 --> 00:04:23.762
You're telling me I missed tall?

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:24.797
Screw you, spelling bee!

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.332
I'm going back to KenKen."

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:28.768
By the way, it is possible
to have a much better name.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.503
You know what Moderna's
vaccine is called?

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:31.937
Spikevax!

00:04:31.937 --> 00:04:33.306
[ Laughter ]
Hell, yeah!

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:35.241
That sounds like a vaccine
that protects you from COVID

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:36.342
and gives you a Mohawk,

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.310
or one of those sketchy
boner pills

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.878
they have at the bodega.

00:04:39.878 --> 00:04:42.281
Spikevax sounds like the drugs
teens are using

00:04:42.281 --> 00:04:44.317
in a YA sci-fi series called,
I Don't Know...

00:04:45.885 --> 00:04:47.019 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.019 --> 00:04:48.821 line:0%
The point is this is huge news

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:50.423 line:0%
and it will, hopefully,
be super helpful

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:52.291
in persuading more people
to take the vaccine.

00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.393
Of course, another thing
that might be helpful would be

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:56.495
getting Donald Trump, the leader
of the Republican Party,

00:04:56.495 --> 00:04:59.232
to tell his supporters
to get it, given that just...

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:05.237
For months,
friends and allies of Trump

00:05:05.237 --> 00:05:06.906
have been desperately
trying to persuade him

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.308
to promote the COVID vaccine
to his supporters

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:12.078
and promotion is the one thing
he should be good at.

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:14.914
He is a salesman and a marketer
and it's not like he needs

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:16.716
full FDA approval
to push a product.

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:19.051
Let's not forget Trump used
to sell health products,

00:05:19.051 --> 00:05:20.319
like scam vitamin C,

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:22.121
marketed through something
called the Trump Network.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:38.070
And, if there's anyone
you can trust

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.072
to tailor something
to your specification,

00:05:40.072 --> 00:05:41.641
it's old Bag Suit, here.

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.775
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:44.143
I do like the idea
that a bunch of people

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:45.611
sent Trump their urine
in the mail

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:46.979
and he had to figure out what
to do with it

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:49.815
because you know Trump
wouldn't just throw it away.

00:05:49.815 --> 00:05:51.150
He'd come up with the dumbest

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.286
and most illegal solution
to make money.

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:54.387
[ As Trump ]
Let's sell it to teens,

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:56.322
to use before they take
drug tests.

00:05:56.322 --> 00:05:57.723
We can give it a catchy name,

00:05:57.723 --> 00:05:59.025
like Comirnaty.

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:00.959
[ Laughter ]

00:06:00.959 --> 00:06:03.629
Trump had no qualms at all
about pushing sketchy vitamins

00:06:03.629 --> 00:06:05.231
and, yet, for months,
he resisted attempts

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:06.865
by friends and allies
to convince him

00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:09.402
to promote a lifesaving vaccine
to his supporters.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.389
Oh, Lindsey,
haven't you learned by now?

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:31.390
It only goes one way.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.025
Trump doesn't listen to you.

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.493
You take orders from him.

00:06:34.493 --> 00:06:36.562
Trump's like
the big city businessman

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:37.864
in a Tennessee Williams play

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:40.166
who moves into town
to buy up all the land

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:42.568
and Graham's the little boy
who does one-off jobs for him,

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:44.069
hoping Trump
will toss him a nickel.

00:06:44.069 --> 00:06:45.504
[ As Graham ]
Meemaw! Meemaw!

00:06:45.504 --> 00:06:48.240
Mr. Trump said he'd give me
a job in New York City,

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.209
if I help him steal the oil
lease from the Hendersons.

00:06:51.209 --> 00:06:53.646
No, you can't come
with me, Meemaw!

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:56.282
[ Laughter ]
I'm going to make
a name for myself

00:06:56.282 --> 00:06:58.483
and I don't want you
bumming everybody out

00:06:58.483 --> 00:07:00.186
with your carpal tunnel sleeve.

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:04.222
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.222 --> 00:07:06.258
That's not to say Trump
doesn't listen to anyone.

00:07:06.258 --> 00:07:08.126
He just listens to the last
person who spoke to him.

00:07:08.126 --> 00:07:10.296
Like when Graham told Trump
to promote the vaccine,

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:12.598
I'm sure Trump agreed and then,
he probably turned around

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:15.200
and took a phone call
from some anti-vaxx nut job,

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.603
Mike Lindell, a Trump friend
and ally who is

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:20.573
so virulently anti-vaccine,
he actually got muted at the

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:23.041
Conservative Political Action
Conference earlier this year.

00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:25.111 line:0%
-In Israel, right now,

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:27.180 line:0%
from the prime minister on down,

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.347 line:0%
we don't know what happened,

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:30.783 line:0%
but, obviously,
congratulated Biden,

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:32.651 line:0%
but after that,
we got a little suspect.

00:07:32.651 --> 00:07:36.355 line:0%
Well, right now,
with the vaccine over there,

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:38.223 line:0%
they're making
the whole country take it,

00:07:38.223 --> 00:07:39.992 line:0%
so you can't go
in shopping malls.

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:41.660 line:0%
You won't be able
to get a job.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.696 line:0%
And, if this happens,
it's the start for the world

00:07:44.696 --> 00:07:47.233 line:0%
and the worst thing that could
happen to this world.

00:07:47.233 --> 00:07:49.001 line:0%
What do you care
what someone else does?

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:51.204 line:0%
If that person wants
to come to a mall

00:07:51.204 --> 00:07:52.871 line:0%
and they don't want
to get vaccine.

00:07:52.871 --> 00:07:54.106 line:0%
This is our bodies.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.041 line:0%
This is mark of the beast stuff
and I don't care.

00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:57.242 line:0%
I'll just put it
right out there.

00:07:57.242 --> 00:07:58.510 line:0%
This is Revelation.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.045 line:0%
I mean, if you're going
to make them do that

00:08:00.045 --> 00:08:01.279 line:0%
over in Israel.

00:08:01.279 --> 00:08:03.349 line:0%
And why do you think
they went to Israel first?

00:08:03.349 --> 00:08:04.450 line:0%
What?! You know,

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.517 line:0%
that's kind of strange.
-[ Laughing ]

00:08:05.517 --> 00:08:07.385 line:0%
-This is weird, guys.

00:08:07.385 --> 00:08:08.487 line:0%
It actually started --

00:08:08.487 --> 00:08:10.656 line:0%
The list started in Spain.

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:11.757 line:0%
It started in Spain,

00:08:11.757 --> 00:08:13.159 line:0%
where Spain started
putting people

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:14.760 line:0%
on this new world list.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.462 line:0%
They're telling you
wear a double mask

00:08:16.462 --> 00:08:17.796 line:0%
and do all this other stuff.

00:08:17.796 --> 00:08:19.732 line:0%
Let me tell ya, that's not

00:08:19.732 --> 00:08:21.767 line:0%
[ No audio ]

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:24.670 line:0%
[ No audio ]

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:24.670 line:14%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.005
-I mean, I bet he was mad
they cut his mic,

00:08:27.005 --> 00:08:28.707
but he also had to be mad
with the picture

00:08:28.707 --> 00:08:29.975
they put up next to him
while he's talking.

00:08:29.975 --> 00:08:31.777
[ As Lindell ]
Don't put up the picture of me

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:34.947
hugging the pillow
like it's my lover!

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:36.949
Not when I'm talking science!

00:08:36.949 --> 00:08:38.884
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.884 --> 00:08:40.586
I mean, they cut off his mic,
but I feel like

00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:42.855
it's also possible his mouth
just never stops moving,

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:44.189
even when he's done talking.

00:08:44.189 --> 00:08:46.259
If he really wanted to scare
people off the vaccine,

00:08:46.259 --> 00:08:48.427
he should just tell people
he got it.

00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:51.063
"Oh, wow. You took the vaccine
and, now, you're like this?

00:08:51.063 --> 00:08:52.865
Well, thank you
for the heads-up."

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:54.033
[ Laughter ]
And even Trump himself,

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.434
when he's taking credit
for the vaccine,

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.102
can't help but use it
as an occasion

00:08:57.102 --> 00:09:00.205
to criticize Biden, as he did
last week on Fox Business.

00:09:00.205 --> 00:09:01.473 line:0%
-I'm very proud of the vaccine.

00:09:01.473 --> 00:09:02.642 line:0%
I've taken the vaccine.

00:09:02.642 --> 00:09:04.242 line:0%
I'm very, very proud of it.

00:09:04.242 --> 00:09:06.612 line:0%
At the same time, some people
don't want to take it

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:08.547 line:0%
and, you know,
when I was president,

00:09:08.547 --> 00:09:09.682 line:0%
you didn't have this problem

00:09:09.682 --> 00:09:11.717 line:0%
with people not wanting
to take it.

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.986 line:0%
They don't take it
because they don't trust Biden

00:09:13.986 --> 00:09:16.321 line:0%
and they don't trust
the Biden administration.

00:09:16.321 --> 00:09:17.423
-People don't trust Biden?

00:09:17.423 --> 00:09:18.891
I mean, say what you will
about the guy,

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.492
but he's way more trustworthy
than you,

00:09:20.492 --> 00:09:22.427
according to both polls
and common sense.

00:09:22.427 --> 00:09:23.863
If you asked Trump
about vaccines,

00:09:23.863 --> 00:09:25.998
he'd end up rambling
about Hillary's emails

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:27.899
or windmills killing birds,
but, with Biden,

00:09:27.899 --> 00:09:29.368
you know, he's not
holding anything back

00:09:29.368 --> 00:09:30.769
because he immediately
blurts it out.

00:09:30.769 --> 00:09:33.005
His aides must watch him
talk to reporters

00:09:33.005 --> 00:09:34.507
the same way
you watch your grandpa talk

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:36.241
to your coworkers
at your wedding.

00:09:36.241 --> 00:09:37.643
What was he saying to you guys?

00:09:37.643 --> 00:09:39.411
"Well, we just asked him
if he was proud of you

00:09:39.411 --> 00:09:40.579
and then,
he told us about the time

00:09:40.579 --> 00:09:42.114
you peed your pants
in Little League."

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:44.016
[ Laughter ]
So for months, Trump routinely

00:09:44.016 --> 00:09:45.885
rejected pleas
to promote the vaccine

00:09:45.885 --> 00:09:47.653
and, even when he did talk
about it,

00:09:47.653 --> 00:09:50.356
he used it as an opportunity
to criticize Biden.

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:52.257
He associates himself
with anti-vaxxers

00:09:52.257 --> 00:09:53.425
and outlets that traffic

00:09:53.425 --> 00:09:55.561
in vaccine conspiracy
theories and lies.

00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:56.996
That's the political movement

00:09:56.996 --> 00:09:58.831
he and his supporters
in the GOP

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.399
and in right wing media
have cultivated.

00:10:00.399 --> 00:10:02.101
So it should come
as no surprise that,

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:04.203
when Trump told his supporters
at a rally over the weekend

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:05.738
that they should get
the vaccine,

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:07.940
well, they did not
react well to it.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.376 line:0%
-I believe totally
in your freedoms. I do.

00:10:10.376 --> 00:10:11.510 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]
You gotta do what you
have to do.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.345 line:0%
But, I recommend

00:10:13.345 --> 00:10:15.047 line:0%
take the vaccines!
I did it.

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:16.615 line:0%
It's good. Take the vaccines.

00:10:16.615 --> 00:10:17.950 line:0%
[ Booing ]
But you got --

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.952 line:0%
No, that's okay.
That's alright.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:22.688 line:0%
[ Booing continues ]
You got your freedoms.

00:10:22.688 --> 00:10:25.057 line:0%
But I happened
to take the vaccine.

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:27.792 line:0%
If it doesn't work, you'll be
the first to know, okay?

00:10:27.792 --> 00:10:28.794 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:30.328 line:0%
I'll call up Alabama, say,

00:10:30.328 --> 00:10:32.398 line:0%
"Hey, you know what?"

00:10:32.398 --> 00:10:33.799 line:0%
But it is working.

00:10:33.799 --> 00:10:34.933
-That really illustrates

00:10:34.933 --> 00:10:36.635
the core problem
of the Trump movement.

00:10:36.635 --> 00:10:38.371
Yes, his followers
listen to him,

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:39.671
but he also listens to them.

00:10:39.671 --> 00:10:41.640
In fact, he doesn't
just listen to them.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:42.941
He's desperate
for their approval

00:10:42.941 --> 00:10:44.510
and terrified
of pissing them off.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.811
[ As Trump ]
Take the vaccine.

00:10:45.811 --> 00:10:47.579
"Boo!"
You didn't let me finish.

00:10:47.579 --> 00:10:50.082
Take it...to the trash
and throw it away.

00:10:50.082 --> 00:10:52.618
[ Laughter ]
"Yay!"

00:10:52.618 --> 00:10:54.386
Trump's obviously
not a man of convictions.

00:10:54.386 --> 00:10:56.721
He and his allies have
cultivated a political movement

00:10:56.721 --> 00:10:58.524
that boos a lifesaving vaccine.

00:10:58.524 --> 00:11:00.459
It's sickening --
months of relentless lies

00:11:00.459 --> 00:11:02.094
and conspiracy theories
about vaccines

00:11:02.094 --> 00:11:03.829
from their favorite media,
politicians,

00:11:03.829 --> 00:11:06.798
and pillow salesmen
and outlets has led to this.

00:11:06.798 --> 00:11:09.868
It's like "Maury," except,
instead of an ex-boyfriend

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:12.437
who refuses to accept
the results of paternity tests,

00:11:12.437 --> 00:11:14.240
they're booing vaccines.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.475
Meanwhile, the rest of us
see that? We say...

00:11:16.475 --> 00:11:17.643
-What?!

00:11:17.643 --> 00:11:20.579
[ Laughter ]

00:11:20.579 --> 00:11:23.983
-Not the picture
with me and the pillow!

00:11:23.983 --> 00:11:25.317
Ohhh!

00:11:25.317 --> 00:11:26.385
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:26.385 --> 00:11:30.055
♪♪

